    "alt": "在明亮的學校餐廳裡，小男孩端著餐盤排隊挑選午餐，櫃檯後方的廚工微笑為他盛上熱騰騰的飯菜與蔬菜。",
    "width": 1536,
    "height": 1024
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo walks into the cafeteria and asks, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "What's for ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "whats-for-lunch"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lunch",
          "phraseIds": [
            "whats-for-lunch"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "lunch"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "?",
          "phraseIds": [
            "whats-for-lunch"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 走進學校餐廳，問道：「今天午餐吃什麼？」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/lunch-choice/1.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "9e375645b6cf2a10be6d6c700b906367ffc7381a0befee8bf720e7828cf83a8d",
        "sha256": "275523c1466cc8ade92b505a5a9a897fc1b7d2fba80ddd7f0ba5bcb5a91188b3"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "He sees hot "
        },
        {
          "text": "chicken",
          "wordIds": [
            "chicken"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "It looks delicious.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "it-looks-delicious"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "他看著熱騰騰的雞肉說：「看起來好好吃。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/lunch-choice/2.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "f43d1f083a0e717907aa8f8269d38c08f8f57878ffb7e8e536c49c0af1593389",
        "sha256": "b09b5b91486a060c720438032bc47e4a049ea7151aa622d7543d9bfc2c8867b1"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo says to the cook, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "I'd like some ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "id-like-some-rice-please"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rice",
          "phraseIds": [
            "id-like-some-rice-please"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "rice"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", please.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "id-like-some-rice-please"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 對廚工阿姨說：「我想要一些白飯，謝謝。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/lunch-choice/3.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "ec712aff3960be0e18b2deb98f6f267aca3a2649b0078dae1ed91e699ce8744a",
        "sha256": "7b61986334b35e46af3f2ac190d85cf25ccb7d9b109d583e2e7de76eb1c8bdbc"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "He chooses a fresh "
        },
        {
          "text": "vegetable",
          "wordIds": [
            "vegetable"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and asks, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Can I have some ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "can-i-have-some-soup"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "soup",
          "phraseIds": [
            "can-i-have-some-soup"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "soup"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "?",
          "phraseIds": [
            "can-i-have-some-soup"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "他選了一道新鮮蔬菜，並問：「我可以要一些湯嗎？」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/lunch-choice/4.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "8b7ee58f2598f3b6f3b800cd0a6b38283c4f85e0d43bb1b0e196738d04ab44a0",
        "sha256": "2ab7061b07cd4b2be295e2204efbb46d2f88d6169d9db6d71aeceacf94c6399f"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "The cook smiles and puts the warm food on his "
        },
        {
          "text": "tray",
          "wordIds": [
            "tray"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "廚工阿姨微笑著，把熱騰騰的食物放到他的餐盤上。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/lunch-choice/5.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "5f9d20d6844d4f9fca33da93e9629c80de05e260604601f02bd8a8f13d4ee073",
        "sha256": "2b303f1d0c84adbf27e4d4a4b92bbea81a565b611e666128e2c6b5d2ec7a26d5"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo sits with his friends and happily enjoys his "
        },
        {
          "text": "lunch",
          "wordIds": [
            "lunch"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 和朋友們坐在一起，開心地享用他的午餐。",
      "audio": {
